WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.467 --> 00:00:03.136
&gt;&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW, ALL WEEK LONG
PEOPLE HAVE BEEN ASKING ME IF I

00:00:03.136 --> 00:00:06.973
WAS GOING TO DO ANY CHARACTERS
FROM "CHAPPELLE SHOW" TONIGHT.

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:11.311 align:start size:94% position:6%
AT FIRST I WASN'T TO.
AND THEN I SAW THAT EPISODE OF

00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:17.183
"WALKING DEAD."
WHERE THEY SMASHED THIS GUY GLEN

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:21.688
ON THE HEAD AND KILLED HIM.
I KNOW, IT WAS DEVASTATING.

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:24.824 align:start size:94% position:6%
I LOVE THAT SHOW WHEN GLEN WAS
LIKE ONE OF MY FAVORITE

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:26.893 align:start size:94% position:6%
CHARACTERS.
SO I WAS LIKE CRUSHED.

00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:29.295
SO -- IN THAT SPIRIT AND WITH
THAT IN MIND, I HOPE YOU ENJOY

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:38.405 align:start size:94% position:6%
THIS.
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

00:00:38.405 --> 00:00:54.220 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ WHISTLING ]
&gt;&gt; HA HA HA!

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:56.556
I JUST CANNOT DECIDE WHICH ONE
OF YOU IS GOING TO DANCE WITH

00:00:56.556 --> 00:01:01.795 align:start size:94% position:6%
DEATH TONIGHT.
HA HA!

00:01:01.795 --> 00:01:05.265 align:start size:94% position:6%
WELL.
I GOT AN IDEA.

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:09.936 align:start size:94% position:6%
BUBBLE GUM.
BUBBLE GUM.

00:01:09.936 --> 00:01:20.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
IN A DISH.
HOW MANY PIECES DO YOU WISH?

00:01:20.713 --> 00:01:23.183 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; BUBBLE GUM.
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

00:01:23.183 --> 00:01:25.852 size:78% position:39%
I'D LIKE TWO, PLEASE.
MY MOUTH FEELS DRY.

00:01:25.852 --> 00:01:29.789 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OH, HE'S A FEISTY ONE.
I LIKE THAT.

00:01:29.789 --> 00:01:33.726
&gt;&gt; WELL, WITH ALL DUE RESPECT,
MR. NEGAN, IN MY LINE OF WORK

00:01:33.726 --> 00:01:40.400
WHEN YOU'RE ON YOUR KNEES, DON'T
GIVE YOU BUBBLE GUM, THEY GIVE

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:42.469 align:start size:94% position:6%
YOU PENIS.
[ LAUGHTER ]

00:01:42.469 --> 00:01:46.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; SHUT UP!
WELL.

00:01:46.673 --> 00:01:51.311
A N -- NAMED NEGAN.
YOU LOOK MORE LIKE A STEPHANIE.

00:01:51.311 --> 00:01:52.512 align:start size:94% position:6%
YOUR FACE LOOKS LIKE -- THE
NEGRO LEAGUE.

00:01:52.512 --> 00:01:54.114
[ LAUGHTER ]
&gt;&gt; STOP IT, YOU'RE KILLING HIM!

00:01:54.114 --> 00:01:55.515
&gt;&gt; THEM SOME UGLY ASS BOOTS YOU
GOT ON THERE.

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:58.618
AS THE WHITE BOYS SAY ON THE
INTERNETS, WHAT ARE THOSE?

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:04.757 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ LAUGHTER ]
&gt;&gt; DRY, BRITTLE JERRY CURL,

00:02:04.757 --> 00:02:11.064 align:start size:94% position:6%
DISGRACE.
HA HA HA!

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:13.233 align:start size:94% position:6%
LOOK AT THIS PASTY BASTARD.
&gt;&gt; OH GOD, NO.

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:20.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ LAUGHTER ]
&gt;&gt; GOOD GOD HAVE SOME GOD DAMN

00:02:20.106 --> 00:02:21.407 size:81% position:41%
RESPECT FOR YOURSELF.
MAN, THE [ BLEEP ] UP!

00:02:21.407 --> 00:02:23.643 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WHAT DO YOU WANT, MONEY?
SEX?

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:24.811 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; SEX ISN'T EVERYTHING.
[ LAUGHTER ]

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:26.646 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; I'LL TRY SOME SEX.
&gt;&gt; I HAVE A WIFE!

00:02:26.646 --> 00:02:28.248 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WHAT?
[ LAUGHTER ]

00:02:28.248 --> 00:02:29.616 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; I HAVE A WIFE!
&gt;&gt; WHAT?

00:02:29.616 --> 00:02:31.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; I HAVE A WIFE.
&gt;&gt; OKAY!

00:02:31.184 --> 00:02:33.987 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ LAUGHTER ]
COME ON, THEN.

00:02:33.987 --> 00:02:36.523 align:start size:94% position:6%
ALL LIVES MATTER.
ALL OF US RIGHT?

00:02:36.523 --> 00:02:39.859 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; NO, YOUR BLACK LIVES DON'T.
&gt;&gt; KILL US FOR WHAT?

00:02:39.859 --> 00:02:46.599 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WELL, WELL, WELL.
I KNOW THAT SMELL ANYWHERE.

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:53.106
FRUSTRATION AND COCOA BUTTER.
LOOKS LIKE WE GOT US SOME NEGRO

00:02:53.106 --> 00:02:56.776 align:start size:94% position:6%
MONSTERS.
PUT THAT BACK DOWN, MONKEY.

00:02:56.776 --> 00:02:58.912
&gt;&gt; MONKEY?
DON'T YOU REALIZE YOU'RE BLACK?

00:02:58.912 --> 00:03:00.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; FROM WHAT I HEAR, THIS HAT
WOULD SAY OTHERWISE.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:06.119
[ LAUGHTER ]
&gt;&gt; IT'S UP TO AMERICA NOW, BOY.

00:03:06.119 --> 00:03:08.855 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; IT SURE IS.
&gt;&gt; WELL, I STAND CORRECTED.

00:03:08.855 --> 00:03:10.390 align:start size:94% position:6%
SEEMS LIKE A LOT OF YOU STILL
GOT SOME FIGHT IN YOU.

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:15.962 align:start size:94% position:6%
THAT'S GOOD.
I LIKE THAT.

00:03:15.962 --> 00:03:20.600 align:start size:94% position:6%
MAKES IT MORE FUN.
YOU CAN BREATHE.

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:25.705 align:start size:94% position:6%
YOU CAN BLINK.
YOU CAN CRY.

00:03:25.705 --> 00:03:27.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OH!
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:03:27.707 --> 00:03:29.142 align:start size:94% position:6%
A LOT OF YOU ARE GOING TO BE
DOING SOME OF THAT.

00:03:29.142 --> 00:03:33.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; THANKS.
&gt;&gt; OH!

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:40.453 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WOW!
&gt;&gt; THE SUSPENSE IS KILLING ME!

00:03:40.453 --> 00:03:42.322 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ LIGHT LAUGHTER ]
&gt;&gt; TAKE IT LIKE A CHAMP!

00:03:42.322 --> 00:03:44.190 align:start size:94% position:6%
COME HERE, YOU!
&gt;&gt; STRIKE ONE.

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:48.528 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; YEAH.
&gt;&gt; STRIKE TWO.

00:03:48.528 --> 00:03:51.497 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; ARRGH!
&gt;&gt; GOT TO BE FASTER THAN THAT.

00:03:51.497 --> 00:03:58.705 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ LAUGHTER ]
MARTY, HELP ME OUT!

00:03:58.705 --> 00:04:04.177 align:start size:94% position:6%
♪♪♪
&gt;&gt; NOTE TO SELF.

00:04:04.177 --> 00:04:09.115 align:start size:94% position:6%
REMIND ME TO TRY CRACK.
[ LAUGHTER ]

00:04:09.115 --> 00:04:12.218
&gt;&gt; WE AS A NATION BEGIN TO HEAL,
THROUGH LAUGHING TOGETHER.

00:04:12.218 --> 00:04:15.955
FOR EVEN THOUGH OUR COUNTRY
SEEMS IRREVOCABLY SEVERED LIKE A

00:04:15.955 --> 00:04:18.858 align:start size:94% position:6%
MAN FROM HIS HEAD, LET MY
EXAMPLE PROVE THAT WE SHOULD

00:04:18.858 --> 00:04:22.262
CONTINUE TO MOVE FORWARD.
LET US SEE OURSELVES IN ONE

00:04:22.262 --> 00:04:28.635
ANOTHER.
FOR ONLY EVERYTHING CAN CONQUER

00:04:28.635 --> 00:04:30.069 align:start size:94% position:6%
HATE.
I AM EVERY MAN.

00:04:30.069 --> 00:04:32.672 align:start size:94% position:6%
I AM EVERY WOMAN.
IT'S ALL IN ME.

00:04:32.672 --> 00:04:35.508
ANYTHING YOU WANT DONE, BABY, I
DO IT NATURALLY.

00:04:35.508 --> 00:04:37.644 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]
&gt;&gt; NOW LET'S BREAK OUT, Y'ALL.

00:04:37.644 --> 00:04:40.213
I ONLY GOT TWO MONTHS UNTIL THEY
TAKE AWAY MY HEALTH CARE.

00:04:40.213 --> 00:04:47.053 align:start size:94% position:6%
BODY, IF YOU WILL?
♪♪♪

00:04:47.053 --> 00:04:48.655 size:84% position:42%
[ CHEERS AND APPLAUSE ]

